{
  "title": "Claude Opus 5.5 默认了，先把“think hard”删掉",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "开场：那句“think hard”现在反着使",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "你每天在 Claude 里敲的那句“think hard”，Anthropic 现在建议删掉。大家好，我是洛洛，今天聊聊 Opus 5.5 成了所有付费计划的默认模型之后，我们那套旧提示习惯该怎么改。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5/"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "官方指南的第一条就是别再堆“think hard”，effort 从 Medium 起步。这跟我们过去两年的直觉是反的——以前能拉满就拉满，能加一句“仔细想”就加一句。官方的说法是，这些旧习惯现在反而在拖慢它。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5/"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "一个真活儿：30 页财报变一页对比表",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "拿一个具体活儿走一遍。周三下午，你要把一份 30 页财报 PDF 变成一页对比表。旧流程是：让它读，发现图表里的数字它读不准，自己手打进去，再要个草稿，再一轮轮改。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5#:~:text=From%20chatting%20to%20setting%20goals"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "现在的建议是一条消息说完：要一页对比表，列是哪三年，单位人民币亿元，缺哪年数据就回来问我。图表别手打，当文件附上。要成品直说，不用先要草稿。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5#:~:text=From%20chatting%20to%20setting%20goals"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "官方说它常常一遍就从请求走到成品；即使最低 effort，读密集图表的数值也比 Opus 5 最高档更准。你给一次初始输入，它能自己把后面几步问自己一遍。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5#:~:text=From%20chatting%20to%20setting%20goals"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "设计任务同理，以及我的建议：先在一个任务上试",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "设计任务同理：别笼统禁“generic design”，直接点名不要奶油色背景、不要胶囊按钮。笼统的禁令只是把一个默认风格换成另一个。接上 connectors 让它自己取文件，结果也更贴你的东西。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5#:~:text=Naming%20specific%20styles%20works%20better%20than%20banning%20generic%20design"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "我的建议是先别急着改团队流程。这些是 Anthropic 自己的说法，我还没看到独立复现。挑一个你真在做的任务，删掉“think hard”、effort 放到 Medium、一条消息把目标和格式说全，跑一次看结果。跑通了，再改习惯。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5#:~:text=From%20chatting%20to%20setting%20goals"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "删掉“think hard”不是图省事，是把话一次说清，把来回留给它。我是洛洛，我们下期见。",
          "citations": [
            "https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-says-outdated-prompting-habits-are-slowing-down-claude-opus-5-5/"
          ],
          "evidence": "CITED",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    }
